    "teaches": "One filter spans ALL input channels: clicking a filter in the bank lights up its 3 kernel slices (27 weights = 3×3×3), all three input channel sheets it reads from, and the single output sheet it writes to — so each filter costs 3·3·3 = 27 parameters and produces exactly one output channel."
